# {{ .RenderedProviderName }} Provider

The {{ .RenderedProviderName }} provider manages Google Workspace **directory**
resources — users, groups, organizational units, roles, and more — as code, on top
of Google's supported [Admin SDK Directory API][admin-sdk] and
[Cloud Identity API][cloud-identity].

It exists because there is no actively-maintained, comprehensive Terraform provider
for Workspace: HashiCorp's `googleworkspace` was a tech preview, last released v0.7.0
in June 2022, and was archived in 2025. This is a thin, purpose-built provider on the
[Terraform Plugin Framework][framework], scoped to what we actually manage.

Resources are named `googleworkspace_*` (for example `googleworkspace_user`).

